HST Office: the Impress sidebar Slide panel selects the slide format once its list is filled, so
"Format" is never left blank when the first state notification arrived before the list existed.

--- a/sd/source/ui/sidebar/SlideBackground.cxx
+++ b/sd/source/ui/sidebar/SlideBackground.cxx
@@ -257,6 +257,13 @@
     //margins
     mxMarginSelectBox->connect_changed(LINK(this, SlideBackground, ModifyMarginHdl));
 
+    // HST: select the slide format now that the list is filled. The first state notifications of
+    // the controllers may arrive before FillPaperSizeEntries (selecting in an empty list) and are
+    // not repeated while the slide size stays the same, which left "Format" blank. Orientation
+    // first: the size handler uses it to normalise the size before matching.
+    maPaperOrientationController.RequestUpdate();
+    maPaperSizeController.RequestUpdate();
+
     Update();
     UpdateMarginBox();
 }
